# Content & DOM constraints

Docs: `docs/features/message-passing.md`, `docs/features/dom-updates.md`.

- **content-script**: forward messages only; use `safeSendMessage` for invalidated context
- **dom-updater**: guard `event.source === window`; never import extension APIs
- postMessage target origin is `'*'` — never put secrets in payloads
- Selector updates: handle `meta`, `title`, and text nodes distinctly (`updateElement`)
- HTML capture at end of dom-updater starts analyze — coordinate with popup injection flow
